Comment: Original Nepali SpellChecking Dictionary, Release 1.1
 (2006-10-17), Hunspell root words and affix rules. Contributors:
 Amar Gurung, Bal Krishna Bal, Basanta Karki, Basanta Shrestha,
 Ishwor Sharma, Laxmi Prasad Khatiwada, Paras Pradhan, Prajol
 Shrestha, Subir Pradhanang. Unmunched and substantially expanded
 to produce the wnepali wordlist.

