Copyright: 2006 Madan Puraskar Pustakalaya
License: LGPL-2.1
Comment: Original upstream README files documenting the Nepali
 SpellChecking Dictionary and Nepali Thesaurus, Release 1.1
 (2006-10-17), preserved as provided by the original compilers.

Files: src/names.txt
Copyright: 2025-2026 Sparsha Bhusal
License: LGPL-2.1
Comment: Nepali proper nouns and vocabulary entries compiled by the
 packager. Includes personal names, surnames, geographical names,
 administrative names, medicinal plant names, and other common
 terms. Sources include general knowledge, educational materials,
 and public administrative information. Base entries were manually
 reviewed; grammatical (suffixed) forms were then mechanically
 derived from reviewed base entries via automated affix expansion.

